shortdesc A 'lipsum' for Persian
longdesc The package provides lipsum-like facilities for the Persian
longdesc language. The source of the filling text is the Persian epic
longdesc "the Shanameh" (100 paragraphs are used.) The package needs to
longdesc be run under XeLaTeX.
